{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"You're following us? You must really want to die","Turn around, meat, last time I say it with words","Keep tailing us and I'll leave you for the crows","I see you back there! You got a death wish?","One more step our way and we stop being generous","Boys, we got a stray following us - should we put it down?","Go home! Go the fuck home! I'm not telling you again!","Want another stop? Come on then, see what happens"}},
{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","reg=gang|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Why you following us, {g:man|lady}? Back off!","I see you creeping - turn around, now","You looking for trouble? Keep following, you'll find it","Stop following us! This your last warning!","Ay, look who still tailing us - back up, fool!","Don't make me come back there!","You tailing us? Bad move, homie - real bad","Go the other way, I said! Don't make me say it with this!"}},
{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","reg=club|tmp=predator,seasoned,veteran",{"Friend, you're following us, that's a mistake","{g:Pal|Lady}, other way - I won't ask again","You're riding our tail, folks who ride our tail end up under the wheels","Turn around, we were being nice, we're done being nice","Back off, {g:buddy|lady}, nothing good for you up this way"}},
{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","reg=club|role=biker_boss",{"I let you walk - don't make me take it back","I don't like being followed, the last one who did it isn't around to tell you why"}},
{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","reg=club|tmp=predator",{"Hoss wants seconds! Turn around, idiot!"}},
{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"You're following us - don't, that's all I got to say about it","Stop following, this stops being business and starts being personal","You got your life back - don't gamble it on getting even","Go back, following us voids your guarantee","I'm going to assume you're lost - turn around and prove me right","Walk away now, or we settle this differently","Last polite request - stop following"}},
{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","reg=prison|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"You following me?! Why you following me?!","Back off! BACK OFF! I got eyes in the back of my head, {g:man|lady}!","Stop following! I'll turn around, and you won't like it!","You a cop? You following us like a cop!","Keep coming, keep coming, see what you get!","Go away! I let you live, go AWAY!","I done time for less than what I'll do to you! Turn around!"}},
{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"You're following us - don't, I'm begging you, I'm too tired","Turn around, stranger, that's the last kindness you get","Following us ain't gonna end how you think","Go back, I don't want to kill you over this","You got a death wish or just no sense? Turn around","Stop, walk the other way - please don't make me"}},
