{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"Don't follow us, we let you go - don't waste it"}},
{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","tmp=fresh",{"Please stop following us! Please!","Why are you following us? Go away! We said sorry!","Don't come any closer! I'll, I'll really hurt you this time!","Please go back, we don't want to hurt you - please","Stop following! We already did the bad thing, don't make us do more!","Go back! GO BACK! Why won't you go back?!"}},
