{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","reg=crime,club",{"Turn around, I gave you your life back - don't hand it over again"}},
{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","reg=crime|tmp=veteran",{"Last time I'm being a businessman about this - go the other way","You're following us, that's the one clause we enforce"}},
{"ROBBERY_DONT_FOLLOW","reg=outlaw,crime,gang",{"You're following, I can hear your boots - stop that"}},
