{"ROBBERY_EXECUTE","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Told you, light 'em up!","Waste this piece of shit!","Kill it! Kill it!","Your funeral, meat!","Should've listened! Get 'em!","Drop 'em, boys!","Bye-bye!","Nobody says no to us! Get 'em!"}},
