{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_1","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Hands up, meat! Up high where I can see 'em!","Get them hands up! Nice and slow!","Put your hands up! Let's see if you can follow one easy instruction!","Up! Hands up! Or we start cutting!","Hands in the air, sugar, and wiggle them fingers for me!","Show me them palms! Up!","Arms up, now! You ain't the first one today!","Hands up! Don't look at him, look at me!"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_1","reg=gang|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Hands where I can see 'em, homie!","Lift 'em up, both hands, don't play","Up - hands up, real slow, like church","Get your hands up, {g:man|lady}, I ain't gonna say it nice twice","Hands on your head! Lace them fingers!","Put 'em up, don't be reaching for nothing","Hands up, and keep your eyes on the ground!"}},
