{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_1","reg=club|tmp=predator,seasoned,veteran",{"Hands up, friend, easy - nobody's in a hurry here","Let's see those hands, up by your ears is fine","Raise 'em - slow, my boys are watching your fingers","Get your hands over your head and keep 'em there, {g:pal|lady}","Palms to the sky, {g:buddy|lady}, like you're flagging down a ride"}},
