{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_1","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Hands up, please, this is a transaction, not a funeral","Raise your hands - slowly, thank you in advance","Put your hands up and we're out of your life in two minutes","Hands up, I'm not asking because I enjoy it","Hands where we can see them, it's just business","Up with the hands, let's keep the paperwork short","Both hands up high, just do as I say and nobody pays extra"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_1","reg=prison|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Hands up! Hands up hands up hands up!","Get your hands up, now! I ain't going back, you hear me?!","Hands up! Spread your fingers! Spread 'em!","Up! Get 'em up! You never stood for a count, did you?","Hands on your head! That's how the bulls did it, now it's you!","Hands up! Quick! My nerves are shot!","Face me and put 'em up where the tower could see, if there was a tower!"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_1","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Hands up, come on, I ain't got all day","Put your hands up and let's get this over with","Hands - up, I'm too wore out to say it fancy","Get your arms up, nobody wants a mess","Hands up, you been robbed before, you know the drill"}},
