{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_2","reg=prison|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Put 'em UP! Why ain't they up?! WHY AIN'T THEY UP?!","Hands up or I do you right here! I got nothing to lose!","You think I won't?! I did worse for less! Hands up!","Hands up! Don't smile at me! Don't you smile!","Get 'em up, get 'em up! My finger's shaking, {g:man|lady}!","You look at me the way a guard looks at me - hands UP!","HANDS UP! I'm counting! I can count, I'm counting!"}},
