{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"THREE! Hands up or you're dead where you stand!","Last chance, meat - hands up or you feed the crows!","Get your hands up or I blow your head clean off! LAST TIME!","Hands up! Final word! After this it's lead!","Boys, get ready - HANDS UP, or else!","I'm done asking! Up, or I shoot!","Three seconds to get them hands up or they find you in a ditch!","You got one more breath to get them hands up!"}},
