{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=predator",{"Hands up or die! Easy choice!"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"Last warning, I'd rather not, but I will"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","tmp=fresh",{"Please! Last time! Hands up or, or I have to shoot!","Hands up! I'll do it! I think I'll do it!","Put your hands up! Don't make me find out what kind of person I am!","Come on, come on, hands up! Please don't make me!","Last time! Please! I don't want to find out what I'd do!","Hands up! HANDS UP! Oh God, please, last time!"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=crime,outlaw",{"Last one - hands up, and we're still out of your life in two minutes"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=crime|tmp=veteran",{"Three, after three, I stop being a man you can talk to","Final notice, after this the account closes itself"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=crime,club",{"Hands up, this is the part where I quit being reasonable","Last time, you're deciding for both of us, and you're deciding wrong"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=outlaw,crime",{"Final ask, I don't want your body, I want what you're carrying"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=crime,club,gang",{"Up - now, there's nothing after this but noise"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=crime,outlaw|tmp=veteran",{"Hands up, I'll count to one"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=outlaw,raider|world=road",{"That's three asks, three's all anybody gets on this road"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=raider|tmp=predator",{"LAST time! Hands up or I put you down!","Three! Boys, get ready, this one's dumb!"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=gang",{"Last chance - hands up or you a memory out here"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=gang,crime",{"I'm done - put 'em up or get put down, that's it, that's both options"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=club",{"Final word, hoss - hands up, or you're a ditch on Tanner Road"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=prison",{"HANDS UP! I ain't going back and I ain't going home empty!"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=prison|tmp=predator",{"Last time! I done the worst thing a man can do and I'd do it twice!"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"Last ask, I'm too tired to be merciful twice in one day"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=crime|tmp=predator,veteran",{"Three, the offer expires, so do you"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=outlaw,club|tmp=veteran",{"I've asked three men three times, two of 'em are buried - hands up"}},
{"ROBBERY_HANDS_UP_3","reg=elite",{"Last time. Hands up, or we stop being patient","Third time. I'm not asking again","Raise them, or I raise mine","Last warning. After this I stop talking","Up, both hands! Now, before I decide for you"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Where the fuck do you think you're going?!","Hey! Nobody said you could leave!","Take one more step, I've been wanting to hurt something all day","You walking away from me?! From ME?!","Back here, meat! Right now!","Keep walking and you'll be crawling!","Oh, we're leaving? Boys, this one thinks it's leaving!","Get back where you were! That spot, right there!"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=gang|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Where you going?! We ain't done!","Ay! Get back over here!","You walk off on me? You walk off on ME?","Don't you take another step, {g:man|lady}!","Back up to where you was! Don't make me chase you!","Yo, they running! Stop right now!","Nah, nah, nah, you don't leave till we say!","Walk away one more time and it's the last walk you take!"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=club|tmp=predator,seasoned,veteran",{"Friend, where are you going? Get back here","Ain't nobody dismissed you, {g:pal|lady}","You don't leave the party before the host, {g:buddy|lady}","Come on back, don't make the fellas ride after you","Wrong direction, {g:pal|lady} - turn around"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=club|role=biker_boss",{"Walk back to where you were standing, slow - please"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=club|tmp=predator",{"Hey! We got a runner!","Get back here, hoss, or I drag you back by the collar!"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Where are you going? We're not finished","Come back, please, walking away voids the deal","That's a warning, return to where you were","I don't chase people, I make them regret it - come back","Turn around, you haven't been dismissed","Leaving early is very bad manners - get back here","Stop, one more step goes on your record"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=prison|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Hey! Where the hell do you think you're going?! BACK here!","You running?! Nobody runs! I never got to run!","Back on your spot! Stay on your spot!","Don't turn your back on me! I hate when they turn their back!","Come back or I break your spine!","Walking away? I tried that once, cost me six more years","Get back here- NOW! I said NOW!"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Where you think you're headed? Come on back","Don't walk away, I'd have to chase you, and I'd be real mad about it","Back here, we ain't done, stranger","Walk away and I'll hurt you, I'm not proud of it","Stop walking, my knees can't take a chase, so don't make me catch you"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,predator|world=road",{"Turn around, {g:bud|lady}, that road don't go anywhere you'll live to see"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=predator",{"Where the hell you think you're going?! GET BACK HERE!"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"Don't walk off, running just makes it messier"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","tmp=fresh",{"Wait! Don't go! Please come back!","Stop walking! We said stop! Please!","Where are you going?! You can't just leave! Can you?","Come back! Don't make me hurt you, I don't want to!","Wait! Where are you going? Come back, please, please come back!","Don't walk away! I don't know what to do if you walk away!"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=crime,outlaw",{"Where you going? Two minutes, I said, not two minutes of walking","Stop, every step you take, this gets less friendly"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=crime,gang,club",{"Back on that spot, you leave when I say the word leave"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=crime,club|tmp=veteran",{"You're walking - don't walk, walking is how this turns loud"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=outlaw,crime",{"Come back, you're two steps from making me chase you, and I hate that"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=gang,raider,club",{"Hey, feet - stop them feet"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=raider|tmp=predator",{"Oh, it walks! Get back here, meat!","You running from ME? Nobody runs from me twice!"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=gang",{"Nah, nah - back up - back to where you was standing","Where you going, {g:man|lady}? We wasn't finished talking"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=club",{"Wrong way, hoss - turn around and come stand in the shade"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=prison",{"Don't you move! I spent eight years watching men walk away!"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=prison|tmp=predator",{"Back! On! Your! Spot!"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned|world=summer",{"Quit walking, I've shot two men in the back this summer and slept fine"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=crime",{"You're leaving early, early costs extra"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=crime|tmp=veteran",{"Come back, walking off is the one thing I can't allow"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=club,crime,outlaw|tmp=veteran",{"Stand still, next thing that moves out here is coming for you"}},
{"ROBBERY_MOVE","reg=elite",{"Back to where you were standing. Now","I didn't give you permission to move","Stay put. One more step and the talking is over","Go back. Same spot, same position","Get back to where you stood. You're not leaving"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Nothing? You're wasting my damn time!","This is what we get? Whole lot of nothing?","Boys, nothing! We did all this for nothing!","Empty-handed after all this, hahaha, you poor dumb bastard","Not one thing coming with us, I oughta hurt you for the insult","Could've shaken a dead one, less damn trouble","What do we get? Nothing! All this for nothing!","All that walking and not one thing to take home - sad"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=gang|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"All that and we get nothing? Damn, homie","Waste of a stop - get outta here","That's all we get? Man, this was time we ain't getting back","We got nothing - nothing!","All you're getting from me is a sad face, {g:man|lady}","Waste of time, straight up waste of time","I almost feel bad - almost"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=gang|tmp=predator,seasoned|world=inside",{"Nothing to take home - you ever have a day like this?"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=club|tmp=predator,seasoned,veteran",{"Well, friend, that had better be worth the time you cost us","Nothing for us? {g:Pal|Lady}, you'll never hear me live this down","Empty-handed, can't squeeze blood from a turnip"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=club|role=biker_boss",{"Let it go, we're not taking anything - ride on","Nothing for us - that's alright, we'll call it a courtesy stop"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=club|tmp=predator",{"We got NOTHING! Hahaha! Hell of a stop, hoss!","{g:Buddy|Lady}, this was about as useful as a ditch full of the dead"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=club|tmp=predator,seasoned,veteran|world=road",{"Whole damn stop, not one thing for the club, huh?"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Nothing for us, that's disappointing, for both of us","You're a poor investment, friend","No return, we'll write this one off","Empty-handed, all this fucking trouble and we walk off with nothing","Nothing for us - go on - before the effort makes me less polite","Well, nobody ever got rich leaving empty-handed","No return at all - hardly good business, is it?"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=prison|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Nothing?! Nothing?! I stuck my neck out for NOTHING?!","Man, this stop makes the cell look good","Nothing! Hahaha! Out in the free world and we still get nothing!","Not taking a thing - that's cruel, {g:man|lady}","Empty-handed! All that work and we get nothing!","Worthless! You ain't even worth the trouble!","This all we get? Sheesh, I feel robbed"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Nothing - figures, that's how this whole week's gone","We got nothing out of you, welcome to Knox County","Not a thing for us - go on, get outta here before I get depressed","Empty-handed, I remember that feeling - it was Tuesday","Not taking a thing - don't come back to argue, either","Should've stuck to church collection plates"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=predator",{"Nothing?! You're lucky I don't take your teeth!"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"Nothing coming with us, can't say this was a good idea today"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","tmp=fresh",{"There's nothing for us - oh - I did all this for nothing, didn't I?","Nothing - I'm sorry, I'm sorry I did this","We're not taking anything - okay - okay, go","Nothing for us, I'm just tired, sorry for scaring you","Nothing - oh God, I'm leaving with nothing and I did all this","There's nothing coming with me - I don't-- just go"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=outlaw,crime,club|world=inside",{"Nothing's coming with us - go on"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=outlaw,crime",{"Well, that got us nowhere, hell of a way to spend the day"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=crime",{"Nothing to bring back, all that time spent for nothing","Nothing for us, consider the time a gift from me to you"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=crime,outlaw,club",{"I'm not taking anything - go on, before I feel something"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=club,crime,outlaw",{"Well, we're leaving empty-handed, hell of a stop, friend"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=crime|tmp=veteran",{"Nothing, I'm going to walk off and pretend this never happened","We're leaving with nothing, that was a bad stop and I'll own it"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=raider|tmp=predator",{"NOTHING?! All this damn trouble and I'm taking NOTHING?!","Hahaha! Look at {him}! All that fear and I'm not even taking anything!"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=gang",{"Man, this was a waste - keep your stuff","Nothing - nothing! Go on, get, you depressing me"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=club",{"Nothing for us - alright - go on, hoss, and eat something"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=prison",{"Nothing! That is a worse deal than I got inside!"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=prison|tmp=predator",{"Nothing! I'm walking away with nothing! That's worse than inside!"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"Not taking anything - go on, I ain't changing my mind"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=outlaw,crime,club|mood=funny",{"Nothing - you want to hear something funny? I'm nearly relieved"}},
{"ROBBERY_NOTHING","reg=elite",{"Nothing for us. You get to keep on walking","Empty-handed. Not worth the effort","Not a thing coming with us. Lucky you","Nothing's coming with us. We wasted our time","We're leaving with nothing. Don't give us a reason to come back"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Go on, git, follow us and we come back for you","Get lost, meat, and don't you come sniffing after us","Run along now, next time we meet, you won't be walking","Go your way, follow us and I'll hang you up as a warning","Scram! Before the boys change my mind!","Off you go - count to five hundred before you move a muscle","That's it - beat it, tell your friends we said hi"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned|world=road",{"Get lost, see you on our road again and you're a hood ornament"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=gang|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Go your way, {g:man|lady}, don't follow us","Get outta here, you follow us, you done","Bounce, and don't come back round here","Walk that way, don't turn around till we're gone","You free to go - don't make me regret it","Keep it moving, you ain't seen us","Go on home, wherever home is now","We done here - don't be following nobody"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=club|tmp=predator,seasoned,veteran",{"We're done, friend - go your way, and don't follow us","Stop's over - walk the other direction","You did good, now go, and forget our faces","Walk on, {g:pal|lady}, we're heading the other way - keep it like that","Go on, if we cross paths again, we'll call this square"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=club|role=biker_boss|world=road",{"Head on down the road, nobody follows, nobody gets hurt"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=club|tmp=predator",{"Get lost, hoss! Tell 'em who let you live!"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=club|role=biker_boss",{"Pleasure doing business - keep the shiny side up"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"We're finished - go your way, and don't follow us","Pleasure doing business - walk away now","You're free to leave, following us would be a very bad decision","Stop's over - don't come looking for apologies","Go on, walk, and you never saw us, understand?","That's all, safe travels, wherever you're going","Walk, and forget this happened - it's healthier"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=prison|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Go! Go on! Get outta here before I change my mind!","Run, rabbit! Run while you still got legs!","Get lost! Don't follow! I see you following and it's over!","Go your way! Walk! Walk!","You're paroled! Hahaha! Get out of my sight!","Beat it! And don't tell nobody you saw us, you hear?!","Walk away, slow, I like watching folks walk away scared"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Go on, git, and don't tag along behind us","Walk, and don't be stupid and follow","Get gone, I got enough trouble without you trailing us","Off with you - go find somewhere that ain't here","Go your way, stranger, we'll go ours - let's keep it like that"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,predator|hour=12,19",{"That's it - get moving before I change my mind"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=predator",{"Get outta here before I decide you're worth more dead!"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"That's all - walk away and we'll both forget this"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","tmp=fresh",{"You can go now - please don't follow us, okay?","Go - just go - I'm sorry - please don't come after us","That's all, you can go, we're not bad people - we're really not","Just go, please... go, I'm not gonna hurt you, I swear","You can go - please don't hate me - just go","Go on... sorry, I'm sorry, just go"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=crime,outlaw|world=vehicle",{"That's your stop over - go on, and don't look back at us"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=crime,club,outlaw",{"Done - walk away from us, everybody's happy"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"Keep doing it right - go home and tell nobody"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=crime,gang",{"We're square - count to two hundred, then move your feet"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=outlaw,crime,club",{"Go on, next time keep clear of the likes of us, that's free advice"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=outlaw,club|mood=funny",{"Off you go, anybody asks, we were nobody worth remembering"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=crime,outlaw|mood=funny",{"That's it, that's all of it - kind of a letdown, ain't it? Go on"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=raider|tmp=predator",{"Beat it! And don't come back looking for a fair deal!","Walk, rabbit, slow, I like it slow"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=gang|world=road",{"You good - go - don't come back looking for us, though"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=gang",{"Aight, you done - walk it off, {g:man|lady}"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=club",{"You're free, hoss, ride safe, walk safer"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=prison",{"Go! Go on! First man I ever let go! Ain't that something!","Out you go, nobody signed nothing - get gone"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"Go your way, I'd apologize, but you'd know I was lying"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=crime|tmp=veteran",{"Our business is concluded - walk away slow, don't turn your head"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=crime",{"Keep it quiet while we leave, and you'll stay alive - well done"}},
{"ROBBERY_RELEASE","reg=elite",{"We're done. Walk away and don't follow","Go. Don't turn around, don't follow us","You can leave. Keep walking, keep your distance","That's all. Pick a direction that isn't ours","Move. If you see us again, it goes differently"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=raider|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Let's see what the meat's carrying - don't twitch","Empty the pockets, and any bag you've got - keep them covered","Hold still while I dig, you flinch, I stab","Ooh, let's see what we turn up - Christmas might come early, boys","Arms out like a scarecrow, I'm going in","Don't breathe on me, I'm checking you","Stand there and think about your mama while I look","Let's find out if you were worth the walk over here"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=gang|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Let's see what you got - don't move","Turn around, hands on your head - I'm checking","Empty them pockets for me, nah, forget it, I'll do it","Hold still, {g:man|lady}, I'm patting you down","Watch them hands while I go through this","What you hiding in there? We 'bout to find out","Spread your feet - wider, I want 'em wide","Stay cool and this be over quick"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=club|tmp=predator,seasoned,veteran",{"Let's have a look, friend - stand easy","Stay still while I shake you down, won't take long","Arms out, I'm going through your stuff, and you're gonna let me","Easy, {g:pal|lady}, just checking the load you're hauling","Turn out your pockets for me, nice and slow"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=club|role=biker_boss",{"Check anything they're carrying - gently, we got cooperation here"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=club|tmp=predator",{"Let's see what you're carrying, hoss!","You got jerky? You better have jerky"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=crime|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Let's see what you have, consider it an audit","Hold still, I'll take inventory","If you've got a bag, hold it open, I'll sort it out","Stand there, my associate will check your pockets","Don't worry, we only take what's worth taking","Let's see what the day's earnings look like","Arms out, this is the boring part, for both of us"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=prison|tmp=predator,seasoned",{"Let's see, let's see, let's see what you got!","Assume the position! Heh, always wanted to say that","Pat down! Like they did us, every day, every damn day!","Stand there - Lemme see your commissary","You got smokes? Tell me you got smokes","Don't twitch! I'm going through everything!","Turn out your pockets! Faster! Faster!"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"Let's see what you're carrying","Stand still, I'll be done before you finish being mad","Let's see if you're carrying anything worth the trouble","Any bag you've got, open it, I've done this more times than I like","No sudden moves, my eyes ain't what they were"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=outlaw|tmp=seasoned,predator|world=hot",{"Hold still, it's hot, and I'm slow"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=predator",{"Let's see what goodies you brought us!"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=raider,gang,club,crime,prison,outlaw|tmp=seasoned",{"Hold still, I'll check you over and we'll all move on"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","tmp=fresh",{"Okay, um, let's see what you have - please don't move","I'm just gonna look through your things - is that okay? Don't answer that","Hold still, please - I'm sorry, I'm really sorry","Just stand there, I'll be fast - I don't like this either","Just, just hold still - please, I'm looking, I'm looking","I don't want to touch your things - God, just stand still, please"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=outlaw,crime,club|world=inside",{"Alright, what's in here? Hold still while I find out","Let's see if you've got something worth taking - this is getting miserable","If there's a gun in here and you didn't say so, we're gonna have words"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=crime,outlaw,gang",{"Hold still while I check, I don't like surprises"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=raider,gang,crime",{"Don't move while I check you - you hurt me, I'll hurt you worse"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=outlaw,club",{"Course this takes time - stand there and let me finish looking"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=crime,outlaw,club",{"Pockets first - slow now, prayer ain't gonna hurry me","Hold still, friend - I don't like doing this any more than you do","If you've got a coat, turn the pockets out too - coats got plenty of hiding places"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"What's this pocket? Hey - hey - what's in this pocket?"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=crime,club,outlaw",{"Let's see how careful you've been - stand still"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=crime,raider,gang",{"Don't reach in there, I'm the one doing the looking"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=raider,crime,gang|world=inside",{"I'm gonna have a proper look - stand there, don't help"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=crime,outlaw|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"Pockets, seams, I always check the awkward places"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=raider,prison,gang",{"Oh, don't get nervous now - stand still"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=prison,crime,raider",{"I'm going through this careful, if you brought a needle, I'll be upset"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=prison,crime|tmp=seasoned,predator",{"If you're wearing boots, off - no, I'm serious - people put things in boots"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=gang,crime,club",{"If you've got a bag, hold it open - don't make me reach blind"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=outlaw,raider,club",{"Anything I need to know before I start? I don't like bad surprises"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=crime,gang|tmp=seasoned,veteran",{"Front first - don't think I'm going to stop there"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=prison,crime",{"Hold still, I check seams too, sometimes they sew things in the seam"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=crime,outlaw|tmp=veteran",{"Pockets, anything you're carrying - same order every time","One at a time - take it out, hand it to me - slow hands"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=raider,gang,prison|world=inside",{"Anything in here gonna stick me? Say it now, or say sorry later"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=club,raider,crime",{"Turn around, let me see the back of you - hands where I can see 'em"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=raider,gang,outlaw",{"You're not deciding what I check - stand still and let me finish"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=crime,club",{"Just hold still, I'll do the digging, you do the standing"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=gang,crime,raider",{"If you're hiding something heavy, take it out and hold it up"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=raider,prison,gang|world=road",{"Empty the whole thing on the road, all of it - I like it laid out"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=crime,gang,club",{"Your things first, then you - don't get ahead of me on this"}},
{"ROBBERY_SEARCH","reg=crime|tmp=veteran",{"I'm going to check you, please, I'd rather you didn't try to help"}},
